ss="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Skipping Installation</span></a></li></ul></li><li style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#minimum-webview2-version" style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Minimum Webview2 version</span></a></li><li style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#customizing-the-wix-installer" style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Customizing the WiX Installer</span></a><ul class="astro-tmlldztg" style="--depth: 1;"><li style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#installer-template" style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Installer Template</span></a></li><li style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#internationalization" style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Internationalization</span></a></li></ul></li><li style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#customizing-the-nsis-installer" style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Customizing the NSIS Installer</span></a><ul class="astro-tmlldztg" style="--depth: 1;"><li style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#installer-template-1" style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Installer Template</span></a></li><li style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#extending-the-installer" style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Extending the Installer</span></a></li><li style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#install-modes" style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Install Modes</span></a></li><li style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><a href="#internationalization-1" style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg"><span style="--depth: 1;" class="astro-tmlldztg">Internationalization</span></a></li></ul></li></ul></nav></starlight-toc><script type="module" src="/_astro/TableOfContents.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Csloo1VZ.js"></script></div></div></div></aside><div class="main-pane astro-zrieslpu"><main data-pagefind-body class="astro-udsv6w3z" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="content-panel astro-37y7t5kl"><div class="sl-container astro-37y7t5kl"><h1 id="_top" class="astro-ge2rlu3s">Windows Installer</h1></div></div><div class="content-panel astro-37y7t5kl"><div class="sl-container astro-37y7t5kl"><div class="sl-markdown-content">
<p>Tauri applications for Windows are either distributed as Microsoft Installers (<code dir="auto">.msi</code> files) using the <a href="https://wixtoolset.org/documentation/manual/v3/">WiX Toolset v3</a>
or as setup executables (<code dir="auto">-setup.exe</code> files) using <a href="https://nsis.sourceforge.io/Main_Page">NSIS</a>.</p>
<p>Please note that <code dir="auto">.msi</code> installers can <strong>only be created on Windows</strong> as WiX can only run on Windows systems.
Cross-compilation for NSIS installers is shown below.</p>
<p>This guide provides information about available customization options for the installer.</p>
<div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="building">Building</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#building"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"></path></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore>Section titled “Building”</span></a></div>
<p>To build and bundle your app into a Windows installer you can use the Tauri CLI and run the <code dir="auto">tauri build</code> command in a Windows computer:</p>
