<p>To embed the WebView2 Bootstrapper, set the <a href="/reference/config/#webviewinstallmode">webviewInstallMode</a> to <code dir="auto">offlineInstaller</code>.
This increases the installer size by around 127MB, but allows your application to be installed even if an internet connection is not available.</p>
