<li>Download the WebView2 fixed version runtime from <a href="https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/webview2/#download-section">Microsoft’s website</a>.
In this example, the downloaded filename is <code dir="auto">Microsoft.WebView2.FixedVersionRuntime.128.0.2739.42.x64.cab</code></li>
<li>Extract the file to the core folder:</li>
